# ScriptPlayerActor: Agon Wastes 03_sand_temple_dark (42b935e4) layer 10, the spa1 driver plus the
# two-actor chain the reset arm of SetIntoStateManager needs: both actors Activate (the second goes
# to the head of the player-actor list), then the second Deactivates (a previous actor is in the
# chain, so 0x573's `!set && previous` arm runs), then the plain suite.
@f260 layer 10
@f300 god 1; give darkSuit 1; give lightSuit 1; give grappleBeam 1
@f320 obj e0024022f
@f400 send e0024022f Activate
@f500 send e00240396 Activate
@f700 send e00240396 Increment
@f760 send e00240396 Deactivate
@f820 send e0024022f Increment
@f900 send e0024022f Deactivate
@f1000 send e0024022f Activate
@f1100 send e00240396 Activate
@f1200 send e00240396 Reset
@f1300 send e0024022f Left
@f1400 send e0024022f Reset
@f1500 send e0024022f Activate
@f1600 send e00240396 Delete
@f1700 send e0024022f Delete
@f1800 obj e0024022f
